{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/b4dcaf514f41450412b1fc0676f7d7a0.poster.avif?t=1765875955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/b4dcaf514f41450412b1fc0676f7d7a0.webm?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/b4dcaf514f41450412b1fc0676f7d7a0.mp4?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Seth, god of the desert, on his quest to fight Apophis. In a game where Fast-FPS meets Rogue-Lite, battle waves of brutal enemies and ruthless bosses. Choose your weapon, fight, die, and rise again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/21e9c229cbc9ac4db4b03f54071f4576.webp?t=1765875955\" width=1212 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/571bdd4d1df51ebfdbe6f857c0b7b4c2.poster.avif?t=1765875955\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/571bdd4d1df51ebfdbe6f857c0b7b4c2.webm?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/571bdd4d1df51ebfdbe6f857c0b7b4c2.mp4?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into battle with a <strong>shield mechanic that encourages risk-taking</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay your foes, tear their soul apart from their body to replenish your shield and resist the most powerful attacks. But act quickly and stay close to them before they reach the underworld. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/22545ba26b52132fdeaf09cf0b6838a9.webp?t=1765875955\" width=1212 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/36af4ad5e5f0b39b32b6632e3c615e47.poster.avif?t=1765875955\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/36af4ad5e5f0b39b32b6632e3c615e47.webm?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/36af4ad5e5f0b39b32b6632e3c615e47.mp4?t=1765875955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of weapons with unique abilities, such as a <strong>slowdown</strong> for the bow or a <strong>grappling hook</strong> on your shotgun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them alongside your melee skills, dash, and spells to defeat your enemies. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/1540c2e6d0e5130bf3808b3ad58df9c9.webp?t=1765875955\" width=1212 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/32b88cf78f36c2e1c313f4f3dcb24eae.poster.avif?t=1765875955\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extra